  <div class="hero">
    <h1>NairaBook is an AI-powered ledger for informal retail traders in Nigeria.</h1>
    <p>
      Simply record a voice note e.g "I sold two buckets of rice for 6000 Naira." and hit send. Your transaction is recorded as a sale, you get instant feedback, and your dashboard is updated immediately!
    </p>
  </br>
    <p>
      You can record a sale, expense, customer credit and repayment, and product stock update. You're the boss!
    </p>
